  "notes": "CONJUGATION (godan -su):\n- Negative: {差|さ}さない\n- Te-form: {差|さ}して\n- Past: {差|さ}した\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive for senses 1 and 3 (takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧). Intransitive for sense 2 (light/color as subject with が).\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{差|さ}して⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates an ongoing state — an umbrella being held up, or light continuing to shine in.\n\nWATCH OUT:\n{差|さ}す is distinct from other さす verbs:\n- ⟦{刺|さ}す→刺す：02111_sasu⟧: to stab, pierce\n- ⟦{指|さ}す→指す：02056_sasu⟧: to point at, indicate\n- ⟦{射|さ}す→射す：02468_sasu⟧: to shine (often interchangeable with {差|さ}す for light)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{傘|かさ}→傘：00639_kasa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{差|さ}す: put up an umbrella\n- ⟦{日|ひ}→日：02249_hi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{差|さ}す: sunlight shines in\n- {杯|さかずき}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{差|さ}す: pour a cup of sake\n- {赤|あか}み⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{差|さ}す: a reddish tinge appears (on face)",
